---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How Wild Excursions collects, uses, and protects the information you share with us."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold sm:text-4xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-brand-carbon/60 dark:text-brand-ivory/60">Last updated: August 2026</p>

    <p class="mt-6 text-brand-carbon/80 dark:text-brand-ivory/80">
      This page explains what information Wild Excursions collects when you use this website, and how we use it. If
      you have questions about anything here, email us at
      <a href="mailto:info@wildexcursions.in" class="text-brand-gold hover:underline dark:text-brand-amber">info@wildexcursions.in</a>.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-bold">What we collect</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-brand-carbon/80 dark:text-brand-ivory/80">
      When you fill out an enquiry or contact form, we collect the details you provide — typically your name, email,
      phone number, travel dates, and trip preferences. We don't collect this information anywhere else on the site.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-bold">How we use it</h2>
    <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 text-brand-carbon/80 dark:text-brand-ivory/80">
      <li>To respond to your enquiry and plan your trip.</li>
      <li>To send you information directly related to a trip you've asked about or booked.</li>
      <li>We don't sell or rent your personal information to third parties.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-bold">Cookies</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-brand-carbon/80 dark:text-brand-ivory/80">
      This site may use basic cookies to understand how it's used and to keep it running smoothly. You can disable
      cookies in your browser settings at any time.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-bold">Contact us</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-brand-carbon/80 dark:text-brand-ivory/80">
      If you'd like your information updated or removed, email
      <a href="mailto:info@wildexcursions.in" class="text-brand-gold hover:underline dark:text-brand-amber">info@wildexcursions.in</a>
      or call <a href="tel:+917755958493" class="text-brand-gold hover:underline dark:text-brand-amber">+91 77559 58493</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>
